    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Hannah &amp; Henry</i></strong> is an episodic narrative-driven game set in the fictional seaside city of Parlamer. Follow the exploits of Hannah, a mentee witch under the tutelage of her black cat Henry (n\u00e9 Goober), as she learns the zany basics of a kind of magic that's not about pointing wands or uttering fancy phrases. With the help of a flippant fluffy feline, Hannah will master the spookiest of crafts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/d64d4565256b1c4a5e1f4e9b81d4acd6.poster.avif?t=1690941914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/d64d4565256b1c4a5e1f4e9b81d4acd6.webm?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/d64d4565256b1c4a5e1f4e9b81d4acd6.mp4?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this first chapter, Hannah will learn about the reality of witchcraft and master the exhausting musical art of casting spells.<br><br>That includes slow, simple spells that have a limited effect.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/131749ff52ee9270e89602a4df3ccb8f.poster.avif?t=1690941914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/131749ff52ee9270e89602a4df3ccb8f.webm?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/131749ff52ee9270e89602a4df3ccb8f.mp4?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And faster, complex spells which are more versatile and powerful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/0df48641b8890d5897a569e65b033d56.poster.avif?t=1690941914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/0df48641b8890d5897a569e65b033d56.webm?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/0df48641b8890d5897a569e65b033d56.mp4?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Photosensitivity Warning: A small percentage of people may experience seizures when exposed to certain lights, patterns, or images, even with no history of epilepsy or seizures.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Hannah &amp; Henry</i></strong> is an episodic narrative-driven game set in the fictional seaside city of Parlamer. Follow the exploits of Hannah, a mentee witch under the tutelage of her black cat Henry (n\u00e9 Goober), as she learns the zany basics of a kind of magic that's not about pointing wands or uttering fancy phrases. With the help of a flippant fluffy feline, Hannah will master the spookiest of crafts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/d64d4565256b1c4a5e1f4e9b81d4acd6.poster.avif?t=1690941914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/d64d4565256b1c4a5e1f4e9b81d4acd6.webm?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/d64d4565256b1c4a5e1f4e9b81d4acd6.mp4?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In this first chapter, Hannah will learn about the reality of witchcraft and master the exhausting musical art of casting spells.<br><br>That includes slow, simple spells that have a limited effect.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/131749ff52ee9270e89602a4df3ccb8f.poster.avif?t=1690941914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/131749ff52ee9270e89602a4df3ccb8f.webm?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/131749ff52ee9270e89602a4df3ccb8f.mp4?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And faster, complex spells which are more versatile and powerful.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/0df48641b8890d5897a569e65b033d56.poster.avif?t=1690941914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/0df48641b8890d5897a569e65b033d56.webm?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2484330/extras/0df48641b8890d5897a569e65b033d56.mp4?t=1690941914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i>Photosensitivity Warning: A small percentage of people may experience seizures when exposed to certain lights, patterns, or images, even with no history of epilepsy or seizures.</i>",
    "short_description": "Presto! Magic becomes real for big hearted latchkey kid Hannah, a witch-in-training under the tutelage of her pet cat, as she learns that genuine witchcraft is not the kind of hocus pocus that she's seen on TV!",
